1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
A 1971 horror drama banned for decades returns in 4K.

2
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:10,620
On October 30, 2026, BFI Distribution and Warner Bros.

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,060
Clockwork released the 4K restoration.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,447
The film stars Oliver Reed and Vanessa Redgrave as Urbain Grandier.

5
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,313
How many years was it banned before 2026?

6
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,300
Yet the film vanished from screens for over fifty years.

7
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:32,760
The restored cut runs 114 minutes, preserving Ken Russell’s unflinching vision.

8
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:38,160
Censors hid it for over fifty years, muting its brutal 17th‑century hysteria.

9
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,340
Now audiences in the UK and Ireland can finally witness the masterpiece.

10
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:48,860
The Devils finally returns, restored in full 4K glory.

